{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53008","headline":"游荆溪 · 严维","name":"游荆溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜官之山溪水南，周处庙前多夕岚。\n看卷云帆歌白苎，劝尝春酒破黄柑。\n长林独往谁能觅，幽事相关性所耽。\n若欲避喧那畏虎，尚从地主结松龛。\n（见嘉庆二年刊宁楷等纂《宜兴县志》卷十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}